<p>Mark a creature with pheromones, signalling to all of your summons within <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 4, 5, 6, 7</acronym> tiles to shift aggression towards the marked creature for <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">3, 3, 4, 5, 5</acronym> turns. Marked targets will receive <acronym class="variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00,<br>mindpower 100">23%, 28%, 32%, 35%, 38%</acronym> increased damage from your summons and your summons will change target to it.</p><p>The increased damage from your summons will increase with your Mindpower</p>